cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these artefacts, please cite the paper given under 'preferred-citation'."
title: "CAPRA: capacity-aware parity risk allocation — analysis code and frozen artefacts"
abstract: "Analysis code and frozen artefacts for CAPRA, the allocation of a bounded human-review budget between language populations: the achievable set of allocations, the price of parity and the price of composition, the L-group solver, the matched-budget audit against group-conditional risk control, and the consistency checks. Per-item detector scores and per-seed metrics are included, so every reported table is reproducible without retraining."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous (under review)"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - content moderation
  - review capacity
  - resource allocation
  - group-conditional risk control
  - multilingual fairness
  - multilingual toxicity detection
